{"seq":4,"slug":"lc0128-longest-consecutive-sequence","title":"LeetCode 128 最长连续序列","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-advanced-ds/lc0128-longest-consecutive-sequence","wordCount":822,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-128-最长连续序列\">LeetCode 128 最长连续序列</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定一个未排序的整数数组 <code>nums</code>，找出数字连续的最长序列（不要求序列元素在原数组中连续）的长度。</p>\n<p>请你设计并实现时间复杂度为 O(n) 的算法解决此问题。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>0 &lt;= nums.length &lt;= 10^5</code></li>\n<li><code>-10^9 &lt;= nums[i] &lt;= 10^9</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [100,4,200,1,3,2]&#10;输出：4&#10;解释：最长数字连续序列是 [1,2,3,4]，长度为 4\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [100,4,200,1,3,2]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：最长数字连续序列是 [1,2,3,4]，长度为 4</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [0,3,7,2,5,8,4,6,0,1]&#10;输出：9&#10;解释：最长数字连续序列是 [0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8]，长度为 9\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [0,3,7,2,5,8,4,6,0,1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：9</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：最长数字连续序列是 [0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8]，长度为 9</span></span></code></pre></div><p>本题看似简单，但关键在于 O(n) 的时间复杂度要求——排序后遍历虽然直观，但排序本身就是 O(n log n)。需要利用哈希表来实现线性时间的解法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p><strong>方法一：哈希集合（推荐）</strong></p>\n<p>核心思想是只从每个连续序列的起点开始计数。将所有元素放入 HashSet 后，遍历集合中的每个数 <code>num</code>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>如果 <code>num - 1</code> 不在集合中，说明 <code>num</code> 是某个连续序列的起点</li>\n<li>从 <code>num</code> 开始，不断检查 <code>num + 1, num + 2, ...</code> 是否在集合中，统计序列长度</li>\n<li>更新最大长度</li>\n</ul>\n<p>为什么这是 O(n)？虽然看起来有两层循环，但每个元素最多被内层 while 循环访问一次（只有当它不是起点时才被跳过，是起点时才被完整遍历）。所有 while 循环的总执行次数为 n。</p>\n<p><strong>方法二：并查集</strong></p>\n<p>将相邻数字（差为 1）合并到同一个集合中。遍历每个元素时，检查 <code>num + 1</code> 是否存在，存在则合并。最终找到最大集合的大小。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>排序 + 遍历</td>\n<td>O(n log n)</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>简单但不满足 O(n) 要求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>哈希集合</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>最优，只从起点开始计数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并查集</td>\n<td>O(n × α(n)) ≈ O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>理论上近似 O(n)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><p><strong>方法一：哈希集合（推荐）</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function longestConsecutive(nums: number[]): number {&#10;  const numSet = new Set(nums);&#10;  let maxLength = 0;&#10;&#10;  for (const num of numSet) {&#10;    if (numSet.has(num - 1)) continue;&#10;&#10;    let currentNum = num;&#10;    let currentLength = 1;&#10;&#10;    while (numSet.has(currentNum + 1)) {&#10;      currentNum++;&#10;      currentLength++;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    maxLength = Math.max(maxLength, currentLength);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return maxLength;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> longestConsecutive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> numSet</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(nums);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxLength </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> num</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numSet) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (numSet.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(num </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">continue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currentNum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currentLength </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (numSet.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(currentNum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      currentNum</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      currentLength</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    maxLength </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(maxLength, currentLength);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxLength;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>方法二：并查集</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function longestConsecutiveUnionFind(nums: number[]): number {&#10;  if (nums.length === 0) return 0;&#10;&#10;  const parent = new Map&lt;number, number&gt;();&#10;  const size = new Map&lt;number, number&gt;();&#10;&#10;  function find(x: number): number {&#10;    if (parent.get(x) !== x) {&#10;      parent.set(x, find(parent.get(x)!));&#10;    }&#10;    return parent.get(x)!;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  function union(x: number, y: number): void {&#10;    const rootX = find(x);&#10;    const rootY = find(y);&#10;    if (rootX === rootY) return;&#10;&#10;    const sizeX = size.get(rootX)!;&#10;    const sizeY = size.get(rootY)!;&#10;    if (sizeX &lt; sizeY) {&#10;      parent.set(rootX, rootY);&#10;      size.set(rootY, sizeX + sizeY);&#10;    } else {&#10;      parent.set(rootY, rootX);&#10;      size.set(rootX, sizeX + sizeY);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  for (const num of nums) {&#10;    if (parent.has(num)) continue;&#10;    parent.set(num, num);&#10;    size.set(num, 1);&#10;&#10;    if (parent.has(num - 1)) union(num, num - 1);&#10;    if (parent.has(num + 1)) union(num, num + 1);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  let maxLength = 0;&#10;  for (const s of size.values()) {&#10;    maxLength = Math.max(maxLength, s);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return maxLength;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><